# Task Execution

## Task card required fields

```yaml
task_id: TASK-<SCOPE>-<NNN>
spec_id: SPEC-<SCOPE>-<NNN>
goal: ""                 # one verifiable outcome
files_to_touch: []       # ≤3 paths — ONLY these may be edited
validation: []           # pass criteria
approval_required: false
```

## Execution

- Edit **only** `files_to_touch` paths
- One task = one logical change; no drive-by refactors
- Structural-only change (types/rename/comments): set `replay_exempt` in task notes
- Business logic / API / prompts: add replay case per `eval/golden_cases/`

## Completion artifact

`eval/task_validation/<task_id>.checklist.md` — all items checked before calling task done.
